1207:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****                          * eligible for an incoming task, we preempt the core with the minimum
1208:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****                          * priority task. Because this core (i.e. xCoreID) was preempted for
1209:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****                          * pxCurrentTCBs[ xCoreID ], this means that all the others cores
