3458:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****          * is defined in FreeRTOSConfig.h then
3459:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****          * portASSERT_IF_INTERRUPT_PRIORITY_INVALID() will result in an assertion
