3461:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****          * been assigned a priority above the configured maximum system call
3462:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****          * priority.  Only FreeRTOS functions that end in FromISR can be called
3463:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****          * from interrupts  that have been assigned a priority at or (logically)
3464:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****          * below the maximum system call interrupt priority.  FreeRTOS maintains a
3465:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****          * separate interrupt safe API to ensure interrupt entry is as fast and as
3466:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****          * simple as possible.  More information (albeit Cortex-M specific) is
3467:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****          * provided on the following link:
3468:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****          * https://www.FreeRTOS.org/RTOS-Cortex-M3-M4.html */
