3748:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****         /* If configGENERATE_RUN_TIME_STATS is defined then the following
3749:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****          * macro must be defined to configure the timer/counter used to generate
3750:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****          * the run time counter time base.   NOTE:  If configGENERATE_RUN_TIME_STATS
3751:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****          * is set to 0 and the following line fails to build then ensure you do not
