5514:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****          * unblocked for a reason other than a timeout xNextTaskUnblockTime is
5515:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****          * normally left unchanged, because it is automatically reset to a new
5516:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****          * value when the tick count equals xNextTaskUnblockTime.  However if
5517:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****          * tickless idling is used it might be more important to enter sleep mode
