5717:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****  * The passive idle task.
5718:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****  * ----------------------------------------------------------
5719:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****  *
5720:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****  * The passive idle task is used for all the additional cores in a SMP
5721:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****  * system. There must be only 1 active idle task and the rest are passive
5722:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****  * idle tasks.
5723:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****  *
5724:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****  * The portTASK_FUNCTION() macro is used to allow port/compiler specific
5725:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****  * language extensions.  The equivalent prototype for this function is:
5726:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****  *
5727:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****  * void prvPassiveIdleTask( void *pvParameters );
5728:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****  */
