6894:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****                     }
6895:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c **** 
6896:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****                     /* If the running task is not the task that holds the mutex
6897:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****                      * then the task that holds the mutex could be in either the
6898:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****                      * Ready, Blocked or Suspended states.  Only remove the task
6899:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****                      * from its current state list if it is in the Ready state as
