6956:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c **** /* If not in a critical section then yield immediately.
6957:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****  * Otherwise set xYieldPendings to true to wait to
6958:../src/FreeRTOS/tasks.c ****  * yield until exiting the critical section.
